<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV MONDAY.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of the following companies will trade ex-dividend on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>    COMPANY		 DIV/SHARE	ADJUSTED STARTING PRICE</p>
<p>Exelixi		 70			 1,065</p>
<p>Intertech	    200			 5,695</p>
<p>As of Monday, preferred stock of Britannia Wool are</p>
<p>converted into common shares, the bourse said.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
